Task 5
      What do these Jira board columns mean: To Do, In Progress, Done, Backlog? 
Answer
      Jira Board Columns 
          1. To Do – Tasks that are planned but work has not started yet.  
          2. In Progress – Tasks that are currently being worked on.  
          3. Done – Tasks that have been completed.  
          4. Backlog – A list of pending tasks, features, bugs, or ideas that may be worked on in the future. 

 
 
 
